# GenUI Studio — Optional BYO-LLM Configuration (Server-Side Vite Dev Proxy)
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (already gitignored) and restart `pnpm dev:hub`.
# Your API key stays strictly on the local Node Vite dev server (/api/architect/stream)
# and is NEVER bundled into browser JavaScript or exported .zip archives.
#
# Leave empty if you only want offline mode (Signal Relay Vault starter, Excalidraw
# zero-LLM compiler, Pivot Macros, Playtest Fuzzer, and Skill Pack / Next.js exports).

# --- Option 1 (Default): Yantra AI (https://apikeys.in) ---
GENUI_LLM_API_KEY=yk_live_replace_with_your_key
GENUI_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.aitklabs.in/v1
# Supported smart routes: auto:fast, auto:cheap, auto:reasoning, or provider/model (e.g. openai/gpt-4o-mini)
GENUI_LLM_MODEL=auto:fast

# --- Option 2: OpenAI ---
# GENUI_LLM_API_KEY=sk-replace-with-your-key
# GENUI_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# GENUI_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# --- Option 3: OpenRouter ---
# GENUI_LLM_API_KEY=sk-or-replace-with-your-key
# GENUI_LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# GENUI_LLM_MODEL=anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet

# --- Option 4: Local Ollama (Zero Cloud API Key) ---
# GENUI_LLM_API_KEY=
# GENUI_LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
# GENUI_LLM_MODEL=qwen2.5-coder:7b
